WEBVTT

00:05:29.238 --> 00:05:31.399
Dobro, odlično.

00:05:31.399 --> 00:05:33.065
Hajde zatvori taj marker

00:05:33.065 --> 00:05:34.905
i stavi ga na sto za mene.

00:05:34.905 --> 00:05:38.125
Okej, uzmi drugi marker iz čaše

00:05:38.125 --> 00:05:40.575
i otvori ga

00:05:40.575 --> 00:05:42.641
i oboji magarca za mene.

00:05:42.641 --> 00:05:45.709
Velike škrabotine.

00:05:45.709 --> 00:05:47.943
Okej, kul, zatvori taj marker

00:05:47.943 --> 00:05:49.445
i stavi ga na sto.

00:05:49.445 --> 00:05:51.723
Uzmi drugi marker i otvori ga.

00:05:51.723 --> 00:05:54.186
Zar ovo nije zabavno?

00:05:54.186 --> 00:05:56.583
Oboji sovu za mene.

00:05:58.884 --> 00:06:01.040
Okej, zatvori taj marker